# Prisma client generates to its DEFAULT location (node_modules/.prisma,
# node_modules/@prisma/client) — see packages/db/prisma/schema.prisma's
# generator comment for why the earlier custom `output` path was abandoned.
# It's regenerated fresh by the root "postinstall" script on every
# `npm install` (dev machine or Vercel build), already covered by the
# node_modules/ ignore above — no separate entry needed.

.vercel
